@startuml UC09_Activity
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

title UC09: Business Activity Diagram - Search Events by Keyword

|User|
start
:Input search keyword into search bar;
:Press Enter or submit search;
|System|
:Execute SQL query with LIKE wildcards across event, artist, and venue names;
|User|
if (Matches found?) then (Yes)
  |System|
  :Render filtered event cards matching query;
  stop
else (No)
  |System|
  :Display friendly "No events found" empty state;
  stop
endif
@enduml
